   "eyebrow": "How a handover works",
   "h1": "",
   "h2": "Five habits that keep it from dropping work",
   "lead": [],
   "links": [],
   "cards": [
    {
     "href": "",
     "n": "01",
     "h": "One owner per workstream",
     "lvl": "h3",
     "p": [
      "A named person is accountable for each piece of work, whichever studio is awake."
     ],
     "tags": [],
     "li": [],
     "kv": [],
     "a": []
    },
    {
     "href": "",
     "n": "02",
     "h": "A written handover each day",
     "lvl": "h3",
     "p": [
      "What was done, what is blocked and what the next studio should pick up first."
     ],
     "tags": [],
     "li": [],
     "kv": [],
     "a": []
    },
    {
     "href": "",
     "n": "03",
     "h": "One backlog, one tracker",
     "lvl": "h3",
     "p": [
      "Every studio works from the same list, so nothing lives in a private inbox."
     ],
     "tags": [],
     "li": [],
     "kv": [],
     "a": []
    },
    {
     "href": "",
     "n": "04",
     "h": "Overlap windows for decisions",
     "lvl": "h3",
     "p": [
      "Where two working days overlap, questions that need a conversation are held for that window."
     ],
     "tags": [],
     "li": [],
     "kv": [],
     "a": []
    },
    {
     "href": "",
     "n": "05",
     "h": "A named lead for escalation",
