  {
   "eyebrow": "Questions",
   "h1": "",
   "h2": "Global delivery, answered",
   "lead": [],
   "links": [],
   "cards": [],
   "faq": [
    {
     "q": "Where are your studios?",
     "a": [
      "Dubai, London, Islamabad and Singapore. Dubai is the global head office."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "How does follow-the-sun delivery work?",
     "a": [
      "Each studio works its own local day. At the end of it, the team writes a handover and passes open work to the next studio, so progress continues while the first team is offline."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Will someone be available in our time zone?",
     "a": [
      "Working hours and response times are agreed per engagement. Overlap with your day is one of the things we plan for at the start, not something we promise for every project in advance."
     ]
    },
    {
     "q": "Is every service covered around the clock?",
     "a": [
      "No. Round-the-clock cover is set in the service agreement for services such as managed operations. Project work follows the studio working days agreed for it."
     ]
    }
   ],
